{
"id": 5432,
"iid": 12,
"project_id": 5030,
"title": "CN NFs out of sync with `oai-cn5g-common-src` `develop` branch",
"description": "Not all Network Functions (NFs) are currently synchronized with the latest `develop` branch of `oai-cn5g-common-src`.\n\nAttempting to sync individual NFs with the latest `common-src/develop` and adapting the code results in multiple build failures across NFs.\n\nThis issue impacts several active merge requests that depend on common-src, including:\n\n- https://gitlab.eurecom.fr/oai/cn5g/oai-cn5g-amf/-/merge_requests/408\n- https://gitlab.eurecom.fr/oai/cn5g/oai-cn5g-udr/-/merge_requests/89\n- https://gitlab.eurecom.fr/oai/cn5g/oai-cn5g-common-src/-/merge_requests/128\n\nAdditionally, adding Ubuntu 24.04 support for CN requires changes in `common-src`. However, these changes cannot be introduced until `common-src` is stabilized and aligned with all dependent NFs.",
"state": "closed",
"created_at": "2026-01-27T14:57:28.734Z",
"updated_at": "2026-08-05T12:43:15.872Z",
