{
"id": 4105,
"iid": 1,
"project_id": 5030,
"title": "Reference to 'PDU_SESSION_TYPE_E_IPV4' in pdu_session_type.hpp is ambiguous",
"description": "When integrating this common src within UDM, i got this error `error: reference to 'PDU_SESSION_TYPE_E_IPV4' is ambiguous`. The issue comes from the fact that the enum PDU_SESSION_TYPE_E_IPV4 is already existed in a API model which is generated automatically by OpenAPItools in UDM.\n(src/api_server/model/PduSessionTypes.h).\nIn this case, could you please e.g., use scoped/class enum in this common src in stead of unscoped enum to avoid this issue.",
